every install would have written slot A (/dev/mmcblk0p2). Five bundles built by
scripts/make-untrusted-bundles.sh at revision 6d5dbc6, fetched with the board-side helper
scripts/try-bundle-on-board.sh (try_bundle). Console capture by the user; host clock in brackets.

